sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Hyperliquid
    participant N as Nautilus adapter
    participant F as Feature engine
    participant S as Strategy
    participant R as Risk authority
    participant E as Execution manager
    participant J as Event journal

    H->>N: L2/trade/context event
    N->>F: Typed market event
    F->>F: Validate freshness and update causal state
    F->>S: Versioned feature snapshot
    S->>R: Order intent with rationale
    R->>R: Account, exposure, limits, health, kill state
    alt Rejected or halted
        R-->>S: Denial with stable reason code
        R->>J: Persist decision and denial
    else Accepted
        R->>E: Approved bounded command
        E->>J: Persist submit intent
        E->>N: Submit/cancel/modify
        N->>H: Signed exchange action
        H-->>N: Ack/reject/fill
        N-->>E: Typed execution event
        E->>R: Reconcile orders, position, PnL, margin
        E->>J: Persist execution event
    end
